<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37708" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-longus</span></b> , a, um, adj.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>very long</i>
			(not in Cic. or Cæs.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homo,</span>”
				i. e. <i>very tall</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 6, 3, 67</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gladii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					22, 46</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cauda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 33, 51, § 121</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hasta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					6, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gracilitas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					13, 4, 9, § 46</span></i>
			.—Of time, <i>very long</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sermones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 10, 3, 32</span></i>
			.</div>
